SUBENT        14871001   20260630   20260821   20260821       1530
BIB                  9         37
TITLE      Evidence for Gamow-Teller Decay of 78Ni Core from
           Beta-Delayed Neutron Emission Studies
AUTHOR     (M.Madurga,S.V.Paulauskas,R.Grzywacz,D.Miller,
           D.W.Bardayan,J.C.Batchelder,N.T.Brewer,J.A.Cizewski,
           A.Fijalkowska,C.J.Gross,M.E.Howard,S.V.Ilyushkin,
           B.Manning,M.Matos,A.J.Mendez,K.Miernik,S.W.Padgett,
           W.A.Peters,B.C.Rasco,A.Ratkiewicz,K.P.Rykaczewski,
           D.W.Stracener,E.H.Wang,M.Wolinska-Cichocka,
           E.F.Zganjar)
REFERENCE  (J,PRL,117,092502,2016)
           #doi:10.1103/PhysRevLett.117.092502
INSTITUTE  (1USATEN,2ZZZCER,1USAORL,1USAUCX,1USARUT,3POLWWA,
           1USACSM,1USALSU,1USAVBT)
           (1USAUSA) Department of Physics and Astronomy, Austin
           Peay State University, Clarksville, Tennessee 37044,USA
FACILITY   (CYCLO,1USAORL) The Holifield Radioactive Ion Beam
           Facility (HRIBF) at Oak Ridge National Laboratory.
DETECTOR   (HPGE,SCIN) The gamma radiations were measured using
           two high-purity Ge (HPGe) clover detectors from the
           CLARION array. The neutron energies were measured
           with the newly commissioned TOF instrument, the
           Versatile Array of Neutron Detectors at Low Energy
            (VANDLE).
METHOD     (TOF,COINC) The 83,84Ga isotopes were produced at the
           Holifield Radioactive Ion Beam Facility (HRIBF) at
           Oak Ridge National Laboratory using the isotope
           separation online technique. The 200-keV ions were
           implanted into a tape in the Moving Tape Collector
            (MTC) in the middle of the beta-gamma-neutron
           counting setup. The neutron energies were measured
           with the TOF instrument VANDLE.
ERR-ANALYS (DATA-ERR) The experimental error bars represent the
           combined statistical and systematic uncertainty. The
           systematic error arises from the variation of the
           Fermi phase-space factor f over the 0.5-MeV binning
           interval.
HISTORY    (20260630C) BP
